Rāma leads Sītā from hill to river --- Rāma praises swan served Mandākinī sandbanks --- Rāma notes herds drinking at turbid fords --- Rāma points sages bathing worshipping sun --- Rāma shows dancing flower shedding trees --- Rāma shows clear pools sandy banks and Siddhas --- Rāma shows wind drifted flowers and calling sheldrakes --- Rāma bids Sītā bathe like friend --- Rāma asks mountain deemed Ayōdhyā river Sarayū --- Rāma rejoices in Lakṣmaṇa Sītā feeling no longing
